{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Pet Hooligan is a vibrant, satirical, 3rd person shooter-platformer filled with cartoon chaos and destruction with both PvP and PvE experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Demo you will be able to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Play Anarchy, a free-for-all deathmatch mode that\u2019s easy to pick up and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Choose a Faction and unlock cosmetic rewards you can keep in the full game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Use 19 different comical weapons like the gumball shotgun or toilet plunger sniper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Compete in 11 different arenas placed throughout Hooliland City</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Ride the skateboard to get around quickly and perform sick tricks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Spray paint everything with your spray can, buildings, trash cans\u2026 other hooligans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the features of the full game below:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/a7e1917e0d129ad3010271900469828a.avif?t=1758217626\" width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform across the city to find new vantage points to eliminate your enemies. Skateboard like a pro-skater and build trick combos to boost your traversal speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/b9cad3b295f529c76fdb89876bcc499a.poster.avif?t=1758217626\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/b9cad3b295f529c76fdb89876bcc499a.webm?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/b9cad3b295f529c76fdb89876bcc499a.mp4?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/b0d483c12e89ac1b1377c0828d4ac188.avif?t=1758217626\" width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies with an arsenal of comical weapons from flamethrowers to toilet plungers. Destroy the cars, crates, and barrels for extra explodey chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/758f34084752bf08642b9cad8274577a.poster.avif?t=1758217626\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/758f34084752bf08642b9cad8274577a.webm?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/758f34084752bf08642b9cad8274577a.mp4?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/99be279a9eea51938d7964f08ac7a4e7.avif?t=1758217626\" width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge allegiance to one of seven factions, from the athletic Rogue Jumpers to the bionic Cypherbuns. Raise the ranks and unlock unique perks to aid you in your battle for control over Hooliland City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/5747e44725a496845edea18b63d242f9.poster.avif?t=1758217626\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/5747e44725a496845edea18b63d242f9.webp?t=1758217626\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/29f5d68bb97e0edcdf89fd6e4d0279d2.avif?t=1758217626\" width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your abilities to the test with both PvP and PvE experiences. Play with friends in a variety of modes including: Sandbox, Free-for-All, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/8f72c58285778d597ddb39b557d7d388.poster.avif?t=1758217626\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/8f72c58285778d597ddb39b557d7d388.webm?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/8f72c58285778d597ddb39b557d7d388.mp4?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/bda9aaf234176870bf3d3a1f54a7fec2.avif?t=1758217626\" width=1560 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Hooligan and flex your sick drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/c8ac4824459b874bb2fd992885a5452c.poster.avif?t=1758217626\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/c8ac4824459b874bb2fd992885a5452c.webm?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/extras/c8ac4824459b874bb2fd992885a5452c.mp4?t=1758217626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011920?t=1758217626","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011920?t=1758217626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/22749d57b53958d1406455661e9a73b589edeb75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758217626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011920/22749d57b53958d1406455661e9a73b589edeb75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758217626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Pet Hoolig